== Description ==

Allows you to add a widget with some number of most recent posts from a particular category. 

== Installation ==

1. Upload the plugin files to the `/wp-content/plugins/hosting96-posts-from-category-widget` directory, or install the plugin through the WordPress plugins screen directly.
2. Activate the plugin through the 'Plugins' screen in WordPress
3. Use the "Settings->Hosting 96 Posts from category widget" screen to configure the plugin

